376
00:22:36,068 --> 00:22:38,029
Find him
back again

377
00:22:38,069 --> 00:22:42,551
Seems to be
like it never ends

378
00:22:42,591 --> 00:22:45,552
Give us hope
through the lava fields

379
00:22:45,592 --> 00:22:47,593
Full shine
of the sun

380
00:24:10,724 --> 00:24:13,608
點解硬係覺得呢排咁酸啊？

381
00:24:15,091 --> 00:24:16,414
喂，我唔為多你㗎

382
00:24:16,454 --> 00:24:18,336
你唔好用我件衫嚟擤鼻涕啦

